      "created_at": "2015-05-11T13:51:20.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Just to see if I could, I made an <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1wg1dwP6aKr4yiHrkQfwcxtwwVo4D_NoEAEOHgvirRJA/edit?usp=sharing\">SotM Randomizer</a> in Google sheets. It compares the random game to see how difficult the game is based on Gray's stats. Or, you can first select how difficult of a game you want, then it will randomize it for you. Not sure if anyone would use this, but wanted to post it anyways. To select custom options, go to \"File-&gt;Make a copy\". If someone finds a bug, please let me know.</p><p>EDIT: Fixed a bug.</p><p>EDIT2: Fixed some more bugs. Also, now anyone can edit it and play around with it.</p><p>EDIT3: Updated Gray's numbers to the latest version. This gave numbers to a bunch of characters that didn't have it before.</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:44:40.247Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
