      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>Just to see if I could, I made an <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1wg1dwP6aKr4yiHrkQfwcxtwwVo4D_NoEAEOHgvirRJA/edit?usp=sharing\">SotM Randomizer</a> in Google sheets. It compares the random game to see how difficult the game is based on Gray&#39;s stats. Or, you can first select how difficult of a game you want, then it will randomize it for you. Not sure if anyone would use this, but wanted to post it anyways. To select custom options, go to &quot;File-&gt;Make a copy&quot;. If someone finds a bug, please let me know.</p><p>EDIT: Fixed a bug.</p><p>EDIT2: Fixed some more bugs. Also, now anyone can edit it and play around with it.</p><p>EDIT3: Updated Gray&#39;s numbers to the latest version. This gave numbers to a bunch of characters that didn&#39;t have it before.</p>",
